    "turn_text": "Well, look, freedom surrenders rarely reclaimed, and part of the reason is you're up against bigger and bigger obstacles. So, you know, the amount of momentum that you need to build up to get the thing moving, it gets harder. And when you look at, you know, the irony of Democrats saying they're defending democracy, if only they could ban Trump from running for re-election, if only they could you know, get illegals to vote. If only they could silence free speech, you know, just more revelations this week about how they've continued their ministry of truth or as they would officially call, tried to call it the disinformation governance board. They're silencing speech, they're invading privacy, and then they're applying leverage to corporations, including media. So if you look at the controlled media, look how the narratives just shift. I was pretty confident that Joe Biden was going to get pulled from the ballot. But the thing that really surprised me is that they stayed with Kamala Harris. I had no idea that they would be able to remanufacture Kamala Harris and create a whole new branded product as a Kamala or something. But now it's totally manufactured. But the poll numbers are real. When I talk to the polls, they're like, yeah, everything about its fake, except the results. The poll numbers are saying people are responding to this. And, frankly, I can't decide who I have more contempt to, the people that are lying, the people that believe the lies, or the people that know their lies and keep repeating them in the media. I can't stand any of them, but it really is a machine that we're up against. And",
